      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "04813_yobidasu_ex7",
      "japanese": "この{歌|うた}は{懐|なつ}かしい{思|おも}い{出|で}を{呼|よ}び{出|だ}す。",
      "english": "This song evokes nostalgic memories.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "04813_yobidasu_ex8",
      "japanese": "あの{写真|しゃしん}は{子供|こども}の{頃|ころ}の{記憶|きおく}を{呼|よ}び{出|だ}した。",
      "english": "That photo called up memories of my childhood.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "04813_yobidasu_ex9",
      "japanese": "{彼|かれ}の{言葉|ことば}は{聞|き}く{人|ひと}の{心|こころ}に{強|つよ}い{感情|かんじょう}を{呼|よ}び{出|だ}す{力|ちから}がある。",
      "english": "His words have the power to evoke strong emotions in listeners.",
